[33.449272, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ diag.event appends to the buffer \u001b[90m(1.295416ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event silently ignores unknown levels \u001b[90m(0.683667ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event enforces 50-event buffer with FIFO eviction \u001b[90m(0.526458ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event drops undefined field values \u001b[90m(0.3595ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event stringifies non-string field values \u001b[90m(0.274709ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event drops fields with overlong keys \u001b[90m(0.258ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.setContext merges into subsequent events \u001b[90m(0.60725ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.env returns the expected iOS-Safari-pertinent fields \u001b[90m(0.397417ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.env handles missing navigator.connection gracefully \u001b[90m(0.617334ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush sends via sendBeacon when document is hidden \u001b[90m(0.576292ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush uses fetch({keepalive:true}) when visible \u001b[90m(4.882ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush clears the buffer on success \u001b[90m(0.497666ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m"]
[33.449451, "o", "✔ diag.flush returns false on empty buffer \u001b[90m(0.369625ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush falls back to keepalive fetch when sendBeacon returns false \u001b[90m(0.763916ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush keeps the buffer when fetch fails (no silent drop) \u001b[90m(0.649708ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush clears the buffer on successful keepalive fetch (visible path) \u001b[90m(0.482583ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush keeps the buffer on 4xx/5xx (no silent drop on rejected payload) \u001b[90m(1.655875ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush in-flight guard prevents overlapping POSTs \u001b[90m(0.877625ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush keeps events added while the fetch is in flight (no silent drop on success) \u001b[90m(0.601958ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ window.onerror handler fires for uncaught errors \u001b[90m(0.46125ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ window.onunhandledrejection handler fires \u001b[90m(0.339041ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ visibilitychange → hidden triggers a flush \u001b[90m(0.302041ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ visibilitychange → visible does NOT tri"]
